# 1-minute history (120 MB) and per-trial daily returns stay out of git: ii_fetch.py rebuilds the
# history, ii_round.py the returns. The trial record, its summary and the round logs are kept —
# for the run on corrected data (here) and the first run on the uncorrected data (run1_uncorrected_data/).
*
!.gitignore
!stage3.csv
!stage3_summary.json
!round*.log
!stage3.log
!run1_uncorrected_data/
